    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af12681628eb1ac46ccdf2e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这冲击性的新闻大大震撼了特雷森学园，\n不，应该说是震撼了整个社会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4088dc8f375dd4b4982e41c0de4c7dd10ae3e0518d53d9dabcd34bc575c7d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
