    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c98663aee1de5b071a3b98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果东海帝王秋季缺席，\n经典三冠的整体情况也会有很大的改变吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f71a22f135c2ff7b0ae43b8b484ec37aed87714e8b4dd5b0289c6f16485c14",
